fix(P+"2023 Paper 1 Q33",r"$C=\frac1{\omega_0^2L}=2\times10^{-9}$ F. At $\omega=8\times10^4$: $X_L=4000\,\Omega$ and $X_C=6250\,\Omega$, so $|X|=2250\,\Omega$. $Z=20R$ gives $R=2250/\sqrt{399}\approx112.6\,\Omega$. Then $I_0=45/R\approx0.4$ A $=400$ mA, $Q=\omega_0L/R\approx44.4$, bandwidth $=R/L\approx2250$ rad s$^{-1}$, and peak power $=I_0^2R=V_0I_0=18$ W. So P-3, Q-1, R-4, S-2.")
